 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "per-worker list of finished sessions (entry, exit, compensation) in time order; calcSalary binary-searches the first session ending after the start and sums overlaps until a session starts at or after the end; promotions are applied at entry. Complexity target: O(log s + overlapping sessions) per calcSalary/O(total sessions) space.",
  "provenance": [
